WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.212
To create a collection, tap the folder with +
and choose “New collection (empty)”.

00:00:06.212 --> 00:00:12.912
Pick an icon. Use the arrows
to turn the page: there are icons and emojis.

00:00:12.912 --> 00:00:19.912
Type the collection's name
and tap Create.

00:00:19.912 --> 00:00:24.372
It starts private, with its basic categories:
only you can see it.

